00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:01.307
but in public service,
that's not always a choice.

00:09:01.574 --> 00:09:05.611
I'm announcing that I will not be
a candidate for reelection to Congress

00:09:05.611 --> 00:09:08.047
in 20, 22.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.982
It's time for me to come home.

00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:14.353
