00:09:55.728 --> 00:09:58.965
But until that happens,
Speer says of her former colleague,

00:09:59.198 --> 00:10:01.634
that should be Feinstein. Lynn's choice.

00:10:01.867 --> 00:10:04.971
Having said that,
you think there should be an age limit.

00:10:05.004 --> 00:10:06.872
