00:10:06.872 --> 00:10:11.043
I said that there is a time for all of us

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.046
when we are

00:10:14.046 --> 00:10:18.451
level of acuity is not as it once was.

00:10:18.751 --> 00:10:22.088
That's an evaluation
